{
  "_about": "FFIEC v1 negative test-vector N021. A routing chain entry per spec §4.4.1 has its `audit.routing.provider_chosen` attribute altered post-capture from 'openai-gpt-4o' to 'anthropic-claude-sonnet'. The persisted `payload_hash` (the SDK-computed MAC over the original canonical bytes) is NOT recomputed. The verifier walks steps 1-8 cleanly, reaches step 9, recomputes the MAC over the tampered canonical bytes, and reports the MAC mismatch.",
  "base_input_shape": "Self-contained: this fixture pins all bytes inline. A routing chain entry is conceptually equivalent to case 001-single-event-empty-prev's single-event chain — seq=1, empty prev_hash — except the entry's `chain_kind` is 'routing' and the entry carries the `audit.routing.*` attribute namespace per spec §4.4.1.",
