    "note": "Variants the same case covers (any one is sufficient to exercise the failure-mode): (a) flip audit.routing.event_type from attempt to success; (b) flip audit.routing.failover_reason from timeout to cost_threshold on a failover entry; (c) flip audit.routing.policy_version from v3.2 to v3.5; (d) fabricate a failover by extending audit.routing.providers_attempted. Each variant lands at the same step-9 MAC mismatch."
